  task-assignment-robotic-warehouse/   TA-RWARE — Copyright (c) 2024 Raul Steleac
                                       see task-assignment-robotic-warehouse/LICENSE
  pyastar2d_TARWARE/                   pyastar2d — Copyright (c) 2020 Hendrik Weideman
                                       see pyastar2d_TARWARE/LICENSE

`wwm_sim/` began as a verbatim copy of TA-RWARE's `tarware/` package and remains
a derivative work of it under the same licence.

Benchmark data under `data/mapf/` is from the MovingAI MAPF benchmark set
(movingai.com/benchmarks/mapf) and is redistributed under its own terms.
Demand calibration under `data/instacart/` derives from the Instacart Online
Grocery Shopping Dataset 2017, used under the terms Instacart published with it.
